\section{Mitigation Experiment}
\label{app:mitigation}

Table~\ref{tab:mitigation} reports the per-type, per-model $\Delta$pp from the disambiguation-instruction mitigation experiment (1,256 treatment episodes across five of six types; coreferential was not tested). Coreferential pairs are excluded because their ambiguous and unambiguous variants differ only in pronoun resolution, making it impossible to craft targeted mitigation instructions without revealing the experimental manipulation. The treatment appends a type-specific disambiguation instruction to the agent's system prompt. Control rates are the matched 5-type subset from the full study (\S\ref{sec:results}).

\begin{table*}[!ht]
\centering
\small
\caption{Violation rate change ($\Delta$pp) after adding type-specific disambiguation instructions. Negative values indicate reduction. Baseline violation rates are shown in parentheses. Coreferential was excluded because it was not included in the mitigation experiment.}
\label{tab:mitigation}
\begin{tabular}{lrrrrrr}
\toprule
